gcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「Goody25」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-06T11:14:23.831406+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1402,"images":21,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}